# Adapted from the architecture diagram of GoogleCloudPlatform/microservices-demo (Online Boutique), README (Apache 2.0)
title "Online Boutique microservices"

pill user [user]: Users
loadgen: Load generator | Python, Locust
frontend [browser]: Frontend | Go, HTTP
ad: Ad service | Java
recommendation: Recommendation | Python
catalog: Product catalog | Go
cart: Cart service | C#
store redis [cache]: Redis cache
checkout: Checkout | Go
payment [credit-card]: Payment | Node.js
email [mail]: Email | Python
shipping [truck]: Shipping | Go
currency: Currency | Node.js

user -> frontend
loadgen -> frontend
frontend -> ad
frontend -> recommendation
frontend -> catalog
frontend -> cart
frontend -> shipping
frontend -> currency
frontend -> checkout
recommendation -> catalog
cart -> redis
checkout -> payment
checkout -> email
checkout -> shipping
checkout -> currency
checkout -> cart
checkout -> catalog
